MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_BoarderDouglasIntro::
	.string "I know PRYCE’s secret.$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_BoarderDouglasDefeat::
	.string "OK. I’ll tell you PRYCE’s secret.$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_BoarderDouglas::
	.string "The secret behind PRYCE’s power...\p"
	.string "He meditates under a waterfall daily\n"
	.string "to strengthen his mind and body.$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_SkierClarissaIntro::
	.string "Check out my parallel turn!$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_SkierClarissaDefeat::
	.string "No! You made me wipe out!$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_SkierClarissa::
	.string "I shouldn’t have been bragging\n"
	.string "about my skiing...$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_BoarderRonaldIntro::
	.string "I’ll freeze your POKéMON, so you\n"
	.string "can’t do a thing!$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_BoarderRonaldDefeat::
	.string "Darn. I couldn’t do a thing.$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_BoarderRonald::
	.string "I think there’s a move a POKéMON\n"
	.string "can use while it’s frozen.$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_GymGuy_1::
	.string "PRYCE is a veteran who has trained\n"
	.string "POKéMON for some 50 years.\p"
	.string "He’s said to be good at freezing\n"
	.string "opponents with ice-type moves.\p"
	.string "That means you should melt him\n"
	.string "with your burning ambition!$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_GymGuy_2::
	.string "PRYCE is something, but you’re\n"
	.string "something else!\p"
	.string "That was a hot battle that\n"
	.string "bridged the generation gap!$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_SkierRoxanneIntro::
	.string "To get to PRYCE, our GYM LEADER,\n"
	.string "you need to think before you skate.$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_SkierRoxanneDefeat::
	.string "I wouldn’t lose to you in skiing!$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_SkierRoxanne::
	.string "If you don’t skate with precision,\n"
	.string "you won’t get far in this GYM.$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_BoarderBradIntro::
	.string "This GYM has a slippery floor.\n"
	.string "It’s fun, isn’t it?\p"
	.string "But hey--we’re not playing games\n"
	.string "here!$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_BoarderBradDefeat::
	.string "Do you see how serious we are?$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_BoarderBrad::
	.string "This GYM is great.\n"
	.string "I love boarding with my POKéMON!$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_LeaderPryceIntro::
	.string "POKéMON have many experiences in\n"
	.string "their lives, just like we do.\p"
	.string "I, too, have seen and suffered much\n"
	.string "in my life.\p"
	.string "Since I am your elder, let me show\n"
	.string "you what I mean.\p"
	.string "I have been with POKéMON since\n"
	.string "before you were born.\p"
	.string "I do not lose easily.\p"
	.string "I, PRYCE--the winter trainer--\n"
	.string "shall demonstrate my power!$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_LeaderPryceDefeat::
	.string "Ah, I am impressed by your prowess.\p"
	.string "With your strong will, I know you\n"
	.string "will overcome all life’s obstacles.\p"
	.string "You are worthy of this BADGE!\p"
	.string "{FONT 0x02}{PLAYER} received the GLACIERBADGE!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_LeaderPryce_1::
	.string "When the ice and snow melt, spring\n"
	.string "arrives.\p"
	.string "You and your POKéMON will be\n"
	.string "together for many years to come.\p"
	.string "Cherish your time together!$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_LeaderPryce_2::
	.string "That BADGE will raise the SPECIAL\n"
	.string "stats of POKéMON.\p"
	.string "It also lets your POKéMON use\n"
	.string "WHIRLPOOL to get across real\l"
	.string "whirlpools.\p"
	.string "And this... This is a gift from me!$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_LeaderPryce_3::
	.string "That TM contains ICY WIND.\p"
	.string "It inflicts damage and lowers\n"
	.string "speed.\p"
	.string "It demonstrates the harshness of\n"
	.string "winter.$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_Sign1_1::
	.string "MAHOGANY TOWN POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: PRYCE\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS: CARLOS$"

MahoganyTown_Interior5_Text_Sign1_2::
	.string "MAHOGANY TOWN POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: PRYCE\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS: CARLOS {PLAYER}$"
